Corpse generation is dependant on several things.  If the 
monster is undead and there is a graveyard in the level, it
is less likely to generate a corpse.  If you kill it (as 
opposed to another monster, a trap, a vagrant wand zap, or
whatever), it is less likely to generate a corpse.  Both
are true for wraiths in the Valley of the Dead, in your
case.

